<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez W.I. Carr sets warrants on HK properties.</title>
<headline>Indosuez W.I. Carr sets warrants on HK properties.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Thursday it plans to issue 300 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five Hong Kong property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd	     0.03577  shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd  0.02645  shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	  0.03719  shares</p>
<p> HKR International Ltd		  0.08547  shares</p>
<p> Tai Cheung Holdings Ltd		0.14286  shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.4730	PREMIUM	 13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1795	GEARING	 5.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  06.MAR.98	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	PAYDATE	 UNAVAILIABLE</p>
<p>REFERENCE SPOT    HK$9.9716</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
